{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-4","kind":"proposition","title":"三角形全等：两边及其夹角相等","englishTitle":"If two triangles have the two sides equal to two sides respectively, and have the angles contained by the equal straight lines equal, they will also have the base equal to the base, the triangle will be equal to the triangle, and the remaining angles will be equal to the remaining angles respectively, namely those which the equal sides subtend.","book":1,"number":4,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.4","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.4/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":4,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-4@raw-67521d02ae10e0b7","contentId":"euclid-1-4","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"67521d02ae10e0b7b8793ba0940dcc2c5faee729d1708f929d91af98a8f54def","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-4.statement","euclid-1-4.construction.1","euclid-1-4.proof.1","euclid-1-4.proof.2","euclid-1-4.proof.3","euclid-1-4.proof.4","euclid-1-4.proof.5","euclid-1-4.proof.6","euclid-1-4.proof.7","euclid-1-4.proof.8","euclid-1-4.conclusion","euclid-1-4.historical.1","euclid-1-4.historical.2","euclid-1-4.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-4.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-4","revisionId":"euclid-1-4@raw-67521d02ae10e0b7","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6330e1797e5e0dfc84f391b677f7785055dd8c2ac3fa36b7dac046b6be6de989","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two triangles have the two sides equal to two sides respectively, and have the angles contained by the equal straight lines equal, they will also have the base equal to the base, the triangle will be equal to the triangle, and the remaining angles will be equal to the remaining angles respectively, namely those which the equal sides subtend."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两个三角形的两组对应边分别相等，并且这两组边所夹的角相等，那么两个三角形全等，对应底边与其余对应角也分别相等。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两三角形，若相当之两腰线各等，各两腰线间之角等，则两底线必等。而两形亦等，其馀各两角当当者俱等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"对于两个三角形，如果两条等腰边相等且两条线之间的角相等，那么两条底边必定相等；两个形状也相等；另一对对应的两个角也相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-4.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-4","revisionId":"euclid-1-4@raw-67521d02ae10e0b7","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"01a3e610d598917c991376df46e9b4585c425085377baed85f97fcd40c81723d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABC, DEF be two triangles having the two sides AB, AC equal to the two sides DE, DF respectively, namely AB to DE and AC to DF, and the angle BAC equal to the angle EDF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"设 ABC、DEF 是两个三角形，AB 与 DE 相等，AC 与 DF 相等，并且夹角 BAC 等于夹角 EDF。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-4.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-4","revisionId":"euclid-1-4@raw-67521d02ae10e0b7","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"39ab347ff261402e441f1f300aa39e38f715e4290da39f25f692260e6e78f2d2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that the base BC is also equal to the base EF, the triangle ABC will be equal to the triangle DEF, and the remaining angles will be equal to the remaining angles respectively, namely those which the equal sides subtend, that is, the angle ABC to the angle DEF, and the angle ACB to the angle DFE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"要证明：底边 BC 等于底边 EF，三角形 ABC 与三角形 DEF 全等，其余对应角也分别相等，即角 ABC 等于角 DEF，角 ACB 等于角 DFE。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-4.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-4","revisionId":"euclid-1-4@raw-67521d02ae10e0b7","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2180803f6510885b882ba340ef4e99cfa460c6ac042abc07a6aa2f5dd1cfa9ce","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if the triangle ABC be applied to the triangle DEF, and if the point A be placed on the point D and the straight line AB on DE, then the point B will also coincide with E, because AB is equal to DE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将三角形 ABC 叠放到三角形 DEF 上，使点 A 与点 D 重合，直线 AB 与 DE 重合；由于 AB 等于 DE，点 B 也与点 E 重合。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-4.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-4","revisionId":"euclid-1-4@raw-67521d02ae10e0b7","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1f34213172bebe4e26644d626790b855fe72296a188198a927911bbcf119f5e2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, AB coinciding with DE, the straight line AC will also coincide with DF, because the angle BAC is equal to the angle EDF; hence the point C will also coincide with the point F, because AC is again equal to DF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于 AB 与 DE 重合，且角 BAC 等于角 EDF，所以直线 AC 与 DF 也重合；又因为 AC 等于 DF，点 C 与点 F 重合。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-4.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-1-4","revisionId":"euclid-1-4@raw-67521d02ae10e0b7","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"47e8bfd10d586ed1783981791e80c806ef2b0218635bfdcc467b6e3fe5c009b9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But B also coincided with E; hence the base BC will coincide with the base EF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"点 B 与 E 重合，点 C 与 F 重合，因此底边 BC 与底边 EF 重合。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-4.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-1-4","revisionId":"euclid-1-4@raw-67521d02ae10e0b7","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fef5d9018ff71292063a4a37f00cc9b8192e275d4890263bd2274f0dbce25cb4","citations":["euclid-1-cn-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"[For if, when B coincides with E and C with F, the base BC does not coincide with the base EF, two straight lines will enclose a space: which is impossible. Therefore the base BC will coincide with EF] and will be equal to it. [[C.N. 4](/principles/euclid-1-cn-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果点 B 与 E、点 C 与 F 分别重合，但底边 BC 与底边 EF 不重合，就会出现两条直线围成一个区域，这是不可能的。因此 BC 与 EF 重合，且两条底边相等。 [[C.N. 4](/principles/euclid-1-cn-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-4.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-1-4","revisionId":"euclid-1-4@raw-67521d02ae10e0b7","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0db66ed3dbf4d1cf4595192470a6ad5f99cfeaa0b507a065c5bd844ad034d79b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Thus the whole triangle ABC will coincide with the whole triangle DEF, and will be equal to it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"于是，整个三角形 ABC 与整个三角形 DEF 重合，因此两个三角形全等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-4.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-1-4","revisionId":"euclid-1-4@raw-67521d02ae10e0b7","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"846e7d59de1845d49a970b7de5172412419a523ed99df1f3b0a997f83f514d8f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the remaining angles will also coincide with the remaining angles and will be equal to them, the angle ABC to the angle DEF, and the angle ACB to the angle DFE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其余对应角也分别重合并相等：角 ABC 等于角 DEF，角 ACB 等于角 DFE。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-4.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-1-4","revisionId":"euclid-1-4@raw-67521d02ae10e0b7","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-4.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-4","revisionId":"euclid-1-4@raw-67521d02ae10e0b7","order":10,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b5521f0f8564b149c14014186b155f391fa7a17e985794d3880f7b18eb295a71","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"(Being) what it was required to prove."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"这正是所要求证明的结论；证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-4.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-4","revisionId":"euclid-1-4@raw-67521d02ae10e0b7","order":11,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"87c5182767976874809885fd7ce73d5ce88c872303fec28c56417a725606b610","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两三角形，若相当之两腰线各等，各两腰线间之角等，则两底线必等。而两形亦等，其馀各两角当当者俱等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"对于两个三角形，如果两条等腰边相等且两条线之间的角相等，那么两条底边必定相等；两个形状也相等；另一对对应的两个角也相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-4.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-4","revisionId":"euclid-1-4@raw-67521d02ae10e0b7","order":12,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2ed50c6caa141fb567ffb143f078a463f7981dd419ae15e2842c33a9e2febd0f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：如云乙丙与戊己不等，即令将甲角置丁角之上，两角必相合，无大小；甲丙与丁己、甲乙与丁戊亦必相合，无大小。〈公论八。〉此二俱等，而云乙丙与戊己不等，必乙丙底或在戊己之上为庚、或在其下为辛矣。戊己既为直线，而戊庚己又为直线，则两线当别作一形，是两线能相合为形。也辛仿此。〈公论十二。此以非为论者，驳论也下仿此。〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：如果说 乙丙 和 戊己 不相等，那么将 甲 顶点放在 丁 顶点上；这两个顶点必须重合，无论大小；甲丙 和 丁己，甲乙 和 丁戊 也必须结合，无论大小。〈公论八。〉 这两个顶点相等，但又说 乙丙 和 戊己 不相同；那么 乙丙 必须要么在 戊己 上方作为 庚，或在其下方作为 辛。戊己 是直线，戊庚己 也是直线，所以这两条线应分开形成形状；两条线可以组合形成一个形状。辛 也按此例。〈公论十二。此以非为论者，驳论也下仿此。〉"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-4.source","contentId":"euclid-1-4","revisionId":"euclid-1-4@raw-67521d02ae10e0b7","order":13,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e54ba477e4a6bb5051d35378455171dec92ee2b728c8f4b729e3310a2acaae34","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.4/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.4\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-1-4:euclid-1-cn-4:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-4","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-4.proof.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-cn-4","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.4","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.4/","sourceLabel":"C.N. 4"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-1-5:euclid-1-4:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-5","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-5.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-4","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.5","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.5/","sourceLabel":"I. 4"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-1-10:euclid-1-4:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-10","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-10.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-4","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.10","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.10/","sourceLabel":"I. 4"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-1-16:euclid-1-4:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-16","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-16.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-4","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.16","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.16/","sourceLabel":"I. 4"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-1-24:euclid-1-4:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-24","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-24.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-4","type":"depends_on","provenan